TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Bu gece ayın en güzel hâlini göreceğiz!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Sonbahar Ayı{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} var,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}{{TAG:0003:001D:}} hem
de inanılmaz olacak!
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}Bu gece {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Minik Bayan Ay her zamankinden
daha parlak ışıldayacak! {{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Manzaranın tadını çıkar, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Tonight's the {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Autumn Moon{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
I've been waiting, {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}like,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} a whole year
for this!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}} It's gonna be {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}SOOO fun!
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}The important thing is that I dress{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
in my nicest outfit.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0021:}} I don't want the
moon to outshine me tonight!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Bu gece {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Sonbahar Ayı{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
Bunu tam{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} bir yıldır{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} bekliyorum!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}} ÇOOOK
